{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"596e12e88f20bda085f475cd8057e433ebcfbd7db4b18a72e7597b0902128ee5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["譴責不誠懇的禁食"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["大流士王第四年九月，就是基斯流月初四日，耶和華的話臨到撒迦利亞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那時伯特利人已經打發沙利色和利堅米勒，並跟從他們的人，去懇求耶和華的恩，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["並問萬軍之耶和華殿中的祭司和先知說：「我歷年以來，在五月間哭泣齋戒，現在還當這樣行嗎？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["萬軍之耶和華的話就臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["「你要宣告國內的眾民和祭司，說：『你們這七十年，在五月、七月禁食悲哀，豈是絲毫向我禁食嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你們吃喝，不是為自己吃，為自己喝嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["當耶路撒冷和四圍的城邑有居民，正興盛，南地高原有人居住的時候，耶和華藉從前的先知所宣告的話，你們不當聽嗎？』」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["被擄的原因是悖逆"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和華的話又臨到撒迦利亞說："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「萬軍之耶和華曾對你們的列祖如此說：『要按至理判斷，各人以慈愛憐憫弟兄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["不可欺壓寡婦、孤兒、寄居的，和貧窮人。誰都不可心裏謀害弟兄。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他們卻不肯聽從，扭轉肩頭，塞耳不聽，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["使心硬如金鋼石，不聽律法和萬軍之耶和華用靈藉從前的先知所說的話。故此，萬軍之耶和華大發烈怒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["萬軍之耶和華說：「我曾呼喚他們，他們不聽；將來他們呼求我，我也不聽！"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我必以旋風吹散他們到素不認識的萬國中。這樣，他們的地就荒涼，甚至無人來往經過，因為他們使美好之地荒涼了。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}